T-005 mutation-resistance proof
================================

Procedure: for each mutation below, the production file was edited in
place (via a Python string-replace script, not a raw sed/patch, so the
exact substring boundaries are visible), the affected suite was run to
confirm it goes RED, and the file was then restored from a pre-mutation
copy and confirmed byte-identical via `diff -q`/sha256 before moving to the
next mutation. All five mutations were applied and reverted sequentially
against the real repository files (never a scratch copy) -- `git status`
and `git diff` were checked clean of residue after each round-trip, and
the full six-suite set (facet-manifest-schema, facet-manifest-semantics,
capability-summary-schema, context-projection-schema, facet-manifest-
staleness, facet-manifest-parity) was re-run green on both runtimes after
the last mutation was reverted (see green-sh.log / green-ps1.log).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Mutation 1 -- RT-20260817-004 revert (validate-facet-manifest.py)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reverts the `except (OSError, ValueError)` fix back to the pre-fix
`except (OSError, json.JSONDecodeError)`, which does NOT catch
UnicodeDecodeError (a ValueError subclass, not a JSONDecodeError subclass).

$ diff -u vfm.orig.py plugins/sdd-quality-loop/scripts/validate-facet-manifest.py
--- vfm.orig.py
+++ plugins/sdd-quality-loop/scripts/validate-facet-manifest.py
@@ -541,7 +541,7 @@
     # quality-gate lesson -- RT-20260817-004; not a design.md/tasks.md
     # instruction; validate-context-projection.py/compare-facet-manifest-
     # staleness.py already carried this fix, this was the one remaining gap).
-    except (OSError, ValueError) as exc:
+    except (OSError, json.JSONDecodeError) as exc:
         sys.stdout.write(f"facet-manifest: manifest-unreadable: {exc}\n")
         return 1

Result: `bash tests/facet-manifest-schema.tests.sh` -- 55 passed, 2 FAILED
(was 57 passed, 0 failed on the unmutated tree):
  FAIL: manifest-unreadable: non-UTF-8 byte input expected exit!=0, diagnostic,
        no traceback, got exit=1 output=[Traceback (most recent call last): ...]
  FAIL: manifest-unreadable: non-UTF-8 byte input expected exactly one
        diagnostic line, got 16: [Traceback (most recent call last): ...]
Restored: `diff -q vfm.orig.py validate-facet-manifest.py` -> files identical
(no output, exit 0).

