--------------------------------------------------------------------------
`git status --short` against plugins/sdd-quality-loop/scripts/ and
plugins/sdd-quality-loop/contracts/ after all five mutations were reverted
showed only the four INTENDED T-005 modifications (validate-facet-
manifest.py, validate-capability-summary.py, compare-facet-manifest-
staleness.py, vendor-capability-registry.py) -- no residual mutation
artifacts, no stray .bak files, and no diff against contracts/*.schema.json
(the vendored copies round-tripped byte-identically).

All six suites (facet-manifest-schema, facet-manifest-semantics,
capability-summary-schema, context-projection-schema, facet-manifest-
staleness, facet-manifest-parity) were re-run green, both runtimes, after
